{"4558930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Eternal Blade", "steam_appid": 4558930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4831560], "detailed_description": "<h1>Open Alpha — Free 2026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be among the first to explore the Baransu Realm. Eternal Blade's open alpha launches in 2026. Wishlist now to get notified the moment it goes live.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her father is gone. Every man she's ever known... vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed to a hellish limbo called the Soulless Citadel by a Dark Warlord, the Light Walker Warriors have been trapped between realms for ten years. Emerald grew up in their absence. She trained, she fought, she pushed every boundary her mother set — and now she may be the only one who can bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prophecy is clear. The last descendant of the Murakai Bloodline must gather the Almighty Gemstones, wield the Eternal Blade, and break the curse. After ten years hiding in the Forbidden Forest, Emerald sets out across the realm. But she's not alone in the race; the traitor Kage is hunting the same gemstones, and if she gets there first, Khaonai and all his darkness are unleashed on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing Emerald has never been great at following orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Baransu Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the dense cover of the Forbidden Forest to the wild sea of pirates in Fukushū Bay, the Baransu Realm is a world with history in every corner. Ancient ruins hold answers nobody has thought to look for. The darkness left behind by the Whisper of Khaonai doesn't rest — and neither do his Dark Ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/052700b6fbd6c61f460b759755248246.poster.avif?t=1786359774\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/052700b6fbd6c61f460b759755248246.webm?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/052700b6fbd6c61f460b759755248246.mp4?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat built on timing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a rhythm. Strike, defend, read the enemy — and when you land the perfect parry, the Almighty Power builds. Let it charge long enough, and Emerald doesn't just fight. She becomes something else entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story four years in the making</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two creators. Four years. Zero investors. Built from the ground up alongside a manga series, an anime screenplay, and a universe that already has fans. <strong>This isn't a story we made up for a game. This world already exists — the game just lets you live in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/04bc67fd9f0004a81f2c7dd5521fdabf.poster.avif?t=1786359774\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/04bc67fd9f0004a81f2c7dd5521fdabf.webm?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/04bc67fd9f0004a81f2c7dd5521fdabf.mp4?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alpha includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 fully explorable regions of the Baransu Realm (Forbidden Forest, Kubu Forest, Fukushū Bay, extended open world)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main quest + side activities (1–2 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full combat system, including the Almighty Power Meter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, cooking, fishing, hunting, mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, materials, and item system rooted in Shibui Universe lore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/95fb966933845f37ff879b70755df250.poster.avif?t=1786359774\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/95fb966933845f37ff879b70755df250.webm?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/95fb966933845f37ff879b70755df250.mp4?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an open alpha. Expect rough edges. Expect soul.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her father is gone. Every man she's ever known... vanished.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cursed to a hellish limbo called the Soulless Citadel by a Dark Warlord, the Light Walker Warriors have been trapped between realms for ten years. Emerald grew up in their absence. She trained, she fought, she pushed every boundary her mother set — and now she may be the only one who can bring them home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The prophecy is clear. The last descendant of the Murakai Bloodline must gather the Almighty Gemstones, wield the Eternal Blade, and break the curse. After ten years hiding in the Forbidden Forest, Emerald sets out across the realm. But she's not alone in the race; the traitor Kage is hunting the same gemstones, and if she gets there first, Khaonai and all his darkness are unleashed on the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good thing Emerald has never been great at following orders.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the Baransu Realm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the dense cover of the Forbidden Forest to the wild sea of pirates in Fukushū Bay, the Baransu Realm is a world with history in every corner. Ancient ruins hold answers nobody has thought to look for. The darkness left behind by the Whisper of Khaonai doesn't rest — and neither do his Dark Ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/052700b6fbd6c61f460b759755248246.poster.avif?t=1786359774\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/052700b6fbd6c61f460b759755248246.webm?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/052700b6fbd6c61f460b759755248246.mp4?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat built on timing</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every fight is a rhythm. Strike, defend, read the enemy — and when you land the perfect parry, the Almighty Power builds. Let it charge long enough, and Emerald doesn't just fight. She becomes something else entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story four years in the making</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two creators. Four years. Zero investors. Built from the ground up alongside a manga series, an anime screenplay, and a universe that already has fans. <strong>This isn't a story we made up for a game. This world already exists — the game just lets you live in it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/04bc67fd9f0004a81f2c7dd5521fdabf.poster.avif?t=1786359774\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/04bc67fd9f0004a81f2c7dd5521fdabf.webm?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/04bc67fd9f0004a81f2c7dd5521fdabf.mp4?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Alpha includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 fully explorable regions of the Baransu Realm (Forbidden Forest, Kubu Forest, Fukushū Bay, extended open world)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main quest + side activities (1–2 hours of gameplay)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full combat system, including the Almighty Power Meter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crafting, cooking, fishing, hunting, mining</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, materials, and item system rooted in Shibui Universe lore</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/95fb966933845f37ff879b70755df250.poster.avif?t=1786359774\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/95fb966933845f37ff879b70755df250.webm?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/extras/95fb966933845f37ff879b70755df250.mp4?t=1786359774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is an open alpha. Expect rough edges. Expect soul.</strong></p>", "short_description": "An open-world action RPG set in the Baransu Realm. Play as Emerald, the last of the Murakai Bloodline and daughter of Sensei Lux, fighting to gather the Almighty Gemstones, wield the Eternal Blade, and free her father from an eternal curse before chaos and darkness are unleashed on the realm.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/ba9167430aba7fcf557f0d255b54cca31e14b658/header.jpg?t=1786359774", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/3bf3aa95850ebe71f8145e570a57ec4b10e4dbb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786359774", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4558930/3bf3aa95850ebe71f8145e570a57ec4b10e4dbb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786359774", "website": "https://www.eternalbladeofficial.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-8500 Ryzen / 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1060 / RX 5500 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-11600K / Ryzen 5 5600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2080 / RX 6700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows Compatible Audio Device</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Shibui Labs LLC"], "publishers": ["Shibui Labs LLC"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "descriptio